            "scene_context": "The heart of light pulses faintly, a dim echo of its potential. Tendrils of luminescent moss, previously inert on the surrounding rock formations, begin to creep upwards, slowly extending toward the light. They move with an almost agonizing slowness, like a time-lapse of life itself. The air shimmers with heat and the faint scent of ozone. The spectral guide subtly gestures towards the heart's surface, its form flickering slightly, as if anticipating your action. The visual style remains painterly, emphasizing the texture of the moss and the fragility of the light.",
